1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The classroom was supposed to be empty after midnight.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
But the lights were already on...

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
humming like insects trapped behind glass.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Desks stood in perfect rows, each one dusted—except one.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
On the chalkboard, fresh writing appeared without a hand to make it: Present.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Present.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Present.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The intercom coughed, and a professor’s voice began calling names from a roster yellowed with age.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Every name belonged to students who died here in a fire thirty years ago.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
One by one, the chairs answered...

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
scraping back on their own.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Then my name came last.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I tried to run.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
But the door had vanished.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Behind me, an empty desk slowly pulled itself out...

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
waiting for me to sit.
